{"asset_key":"ep2/herohub_story_12411300","episode":"ep2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"12411300","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1241130001:1":{"text":"Chippy, where did you get that sword from?","source_cn":"满满，你从哪里又买了一把剑？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F320C6D939F66F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1241130002:1":{"text":"I found it in the ruins! Someone's name is engraved on it.","source_cn":"是我从废墟里找到的！剑上似乎刻着名字。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF523C90BD0C347A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1241130003:1":{"text":"The name is Jor... sen? The middle part of the name is eroded...","source_cn":"似乎叫……乔什么森？名字中间被腐蚀了，看不清……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7906AC42D4DCB64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1241130004:1":{"text":"There is another inscription that reads \"Sword of Knight\"...","source_cn":"最后还有一个刻印，“骑士之剑”……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA225F89607262BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1241130005:1":{"text":"Eh?! Sword of Knight?!","source_cn":"——诶？！骑士之剑？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x060C614C67A17298","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1241130005":{"text":"Eh?! Sword of Knight?!","source_cn":"——诶？！骑士之剑？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x060C614C67A17298","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1241130007:1":{"text":"If so, how did this sword end up here...","source_cn":"没有骑士，那这把剑是哪里来的呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x907B300833638F40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1241130008:1":{"text":"Could it... belong to someone who aspires to become a knight?","source_cn":"难道是……某个梦想着成为骑士的人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71DCB7A7F44866E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1241130008":{"text":"Could it... belong to someone who aspires to become a knight?","source_cn":"难道是……某个梦想着成为骑士的人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71DCB7A7F44866E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1241130009:1":{"text":"That's right! Chippy went through the same thing!","source_cn":"没错，因为满满也是这样过来的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E8AB507D5194B75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1241130010:1":{"text":"There will always be people who dream of becoming a knight, no matter where they grow up.","source_cn":"无论在什么样的环境里生长，总会有人拥有伟大的骑士之梦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x759C7FFF01C8CC5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1241130011:1":{"text":"Chippy thinks the sword might belong to a nameless knight who chanced upon the Dead Tide Fleet raiding the village. He must have valiantly drawn his sword to drive away those undead monsters for the villagers!","source_cn":"满满觉得，可能是某位没能留下名字的骑士路过绿水村，正巧...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5607A9B192CFFE11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1241130012:1":{"text":"He must have given his all to protect the villagers, but... the Dead Tide Fleet was just too powerful, and it was too late to call for help. That's probably why the sword was left behind here...","source_cn":"他一定拼尽全力保护了很多人。只不过……死潮舰队太强了，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x231304AAE169B23A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1241130012":{"text":"He must have given his all to protect the villagers, but... the Dead Tide Fleet was just too powerful, and it was too late to call for help. That's probably why the sword was left behind here...","source_cn":"他一定拼尽全力保护了很多人。只不过……死潮舰队太强了，绿水村也来不及向外求援，这把剑才会被留在这里……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x231304AAE169B23A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1241130013:1":{"text":"Indeed, he's a true knight!","source_cn":"没错，他是一名合格的骑士！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7E96588FBA8EB0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1241130014:1":{"text":"My dream's always been to be a true knight like him—fighting with everything I've got to protect everyone!","source_cn":"满满一直以来的梦想，也是像他这样，成为名副其实的骑士，...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0F1C280B507A029D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"My dream's always been to be a true knight like him—fighting with everything I've got to protect everyone!","female":"My dream's always been to be a true knight like him—fighting with everything I've got to protect everyone!","variant_male_record_index":"136218","variant_female_record_index":"136219","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1241130015:1":{"text":"Magister, Chippy wants to take this sword out and bury it somewhere scenic.","source_cn":"主人，满满想拔出这把剑，安葬在一个风光秀丽的地方。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x83EB9300FB86F564","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Magister, Chippy wants to take this sword out and bury it somewhere scenic.","female":"Magister, Chippy wants to take this sword out and bury it somewhere scenic.","variant_male_record_index":"136220","variant_female_record_index":"136221","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say: